-- Ordered quest guidance; source 967020b2b8ca645afcaf90d9bbe5a1b64673947d; generated 2026-10-20.
QuestGuidance.Register("en",350,{
[11169]="700561E2\n1\tPlant seeds (total: 6)\tTurned soil can be found throughout the neighbourhoods of the Rohan Kingstead. You should plant seeds.\n",
[11170]="700332E8\n1\tDefeat Ghâsh-hai Orcs protecting the altars that surround The Cross-roads of Ash\tGhâsh-hai Orcs can be found protecting the altars located around The Cross-roads of Ash. You should defeat many Orcs in the areas surrounding The Cross-roads of Ash.\n2\tDefeat Ghâsh-hai Orcs protecting the altars that surround The Cross-roads of Ash (total: 8)\tGhâsh-hai Orcs can be found protecting the altars located around The Cross-roads of Ash. You should defeat many Orcs in the areas surrounding The Cross-roads of Ash.\n3\tCompleted\tYou have defeated a number of Orcs around The Cross-roads of Ash as they protected their altars.\n",
[11171]="70016726\n1\tCollect White Hand armour\030Collect the tattered White Hand banner\030Collect the White Hand leg-bone\030Collect the White Hand skull\tThe White Hand expedition was exploring the Claw Hollow, to the south-east of the Orc-watch. Ingifast has instructed you to locate the remains of the previous expedition and bring them back in the bag he supplied.\n2\tBring the remains to Ingifast at the Orc-watch\tIngifast is at the Orc-watch, north-west of the Claw Hollow. Ingifast will be eager to see the remains you collected of the previous White Hand expedition.\n",
[11172]="700597AF\n1\tCollect acorns (total: 8)\030Collect pine-cones (total: 8)\030Collect saplings (total: 6)\tSeeds and saplings to replenish the Wildwood can be found in central Wildwood. Thornmane has asked you to gather seeds and saplings to help restore the forest.\n2\tTalk to Thornmane\tThornmane is in the eastern Wildwood. You should talk to Thornmane.\n",
[11173]="7002B926\n1\tInspect the ground at ideal locations for fireworks demonstrations (total: 6)\tLook for ideal locations for firework demonstrations around the town of Bree. Inspect the ground at these locations, and you may perform a firework demonstration to observers.\n2\tSpeak with the young hobbits at the Bree Fireworks Show area\tReturn to the young hobbits at the fireworks show area in Bree, and inform them of your actions.\n",
[11174]="700607E7\n1\tYou should give Gandalf's sparklers to the children of Bree.\t\n",
[11175]="70044ABA\n1\tSpeak to Harnion\tTalk to Harnion in the Training Ground about sparring with his soldiers.\n",
[11176]="7003EAFE\n1\tDefeat drakes in the giants' valley (total: 6)\tThere are drakes dwelling east of the High Moor in the Trollshaws. While in the giants' valley, you should attempt to drive off the drakes which have come down from the Misty Mountains.\n",
[11177]="7002C9A1\n1\tDestroy worm-eggs (total: 9)\tWorm-eggs can be found throughout the Teeming Nest. You should destroy worm-eggs in the Teeming Nest to slow the rate of spawn of the vile worms in Eorlsmead.\n2\tReturn to Sabert\tSabert awaits you at the front gate of Stangard. You should return to Sabert.\n",
[11178]="700430D3\n1\tTalk to a guard in Tumladen\tGuards can be found throughout Tumladen in northern Upper Lebennin. Faltharan has asked you to seek out a guard of Tumladen and determine who speaks for the people of the settlement.\n2\tTalk to Imladir in Tumladen\tImladir can be found at the barracks near the entrance to Tumladen in northern Upper Lebennin. A guard of Tumladen has directed you to a man named Imladir. You should find and speak to him.\n3\tTalk to Lady Terenis in the great hall of Tumladen\tLady Terenis can be found in the great hall of Tumladen in north-western Upper Lebennin. Imladir has informed you that Lady Terenis, the sister of Steward Denethor, has placed herself in charge of Tumladen.\n",
[11179]="700320F3\n1\tSpeak to Hwitmon and reveal the truth\tHwitmon can be found at his home within Cliving. Hwitmon awaits news of your venture to Randgar's farm with his daughter, Inhild. You have decided to reveal the truth to him.\n",
[11180]="70028C8F\n1\tCollect spears from Brôntrig (total: 5)\tDunlending sentries can be found at Brôntrig, west and south of Forthbrond. Ardwyn has asked you to seize spears from the Dunlending sentries at Brôntrig and bring them back to Forthbrond.\n2\tBring the Dunlending spears to Ardwyn at Forthbrond\tArdwyn is at Forthbrond, north and east of Brôntrig. You should bring the spears you recovered to Ardwyn.\n",
[11181]="700571B5\n1\tGather spears from within Tithroz (total: 4)\tSpears can be found in the cave of Tithroz in the Floodfells. You should collect the spears from Tithroz.\n2\tSearch for the remaining spears\tSpears can be found in the cave of Tithroz in the Floodfells. You should collect the spears from Tithroz.\n3\tSearch for the remaining spears\tA clue can be found in the cave of Tithroz in the Floodfells. You should search Tithroz for sign of the missing spears.\n4\tSeek out the Taurogrim at Shulgmokh\tTaurogrim can be found at Shulgmokh in the Floodfells. You should seek out the Taurogrim.\n5\tRetrieve spears from the Taurogrim (total: 6)\tTaurogrim can be found at Shulgmokh in the Floodfells. You should defeat Taurogrim and retrieve the missing spears.\n6\tEmpty barrels can be found in Limlók. You should place the spears in the empty barrels.\t\n",
[11182]="700190FC\n1\tBring the package to Hethuwen in the Shadowed Refuge\030Deliver the package to Hethuwen in Shadowed Refuge\tHethuwen can be found in the Shadowed Refuge, in the south-eastern reaches of Moria. Hasta has asked you to take the package to his friend Hethuwen in the Shadowed Refuge.\n",
[11183]="700033D1\n1\tSearch for the Black Rider at night\tOdovacar Bolger's sties are in the southern part of Budgeford by the stream. Odovacar Bolger has asked you to investigate his workhands' reports by going to his pig sties. He was very particular that you should go there at night.\n2\tConfront the \"Black Rider\"\tThe \"Black Rider\" is attempting to menace the Bolger sties. This \"Black Rider\" looks rather less threatening than expected. You should confront him and find out what's really going on.\n3\tTalk to Odovacar Bolger\tOdovacar Bolger is at his home up the hill in the centre of Budgeford. Odovacar Bolger sent you to investigate his workhands' claims of a Black Rider lurking in his pig sties. What you found was a hobbit dressed in a black cloak. You should report your discovery to Odovacar.\n",
[11184]="70036A41\n1\tDefeat the spiders assaulting the crystal ([see journal]/6)\030Defeat Scimgrit\tProtect the central crystal from being covered in webbing by the waves of cave spiders. Search the spiders' tunnel for trapped Rohirrim and defeat the cave spider queen, Scimgrit.\n",
[11185]="700380F0\n1\tDefeat the spiders assaulting the crystal ([see journal]/6)\030Defeat Scimgrit\tProtect the central crystal from being covered in webbing by the waves of cave spiders. Search the spiders' tunnel for trapped Rohirrim and defeat the cave spider queen, Scimgrit.\n",
[11186]="700082CD\n1\tCollect the gem pouch\tThe lost pouch of gems is somewhere in the area called the Snares, south of Esteldín. Holger Tanner, a merchant who escaped an attack by spiders, has asked you to recover his companions' missing pouch of gems from the spiders' lair.\n2\tTalk to Holger Tanner\030Collect Pouch of Gems\tHolger Tanner is at Esteldín. Holger Tanner, a merchant who escaped an attack by spiders, has asked you to recover his companions' missing pouch of gems.\n",
[11187]="7000B3DE\n1\tEscort Caragdal to the Grimwood Lumber Camp\tCaragdal can be found in the ruins near the Grimwood Lumber Camp, nesting amongst her broodlings. Caragdal must be escorted safely to the Grimwood Lumber Camp. This stage includes failure conditions; check the journal before choosing objects or actions.\n2\tReturn to Soldier Golb with news of your success\tSoldier Golb is in the Grimwood Lumber Camp. You should return to Soldier Golb with the news that Caragdal is on the move.\n",
[11188]="70000DC5\n1\tBring the trade goods back to Otho Broadbelt\030Collect the trade goods\tOtho Broadbelt's waggon is just off the road to the north-east of Overhill, next to the falls. Otho Broadbelt needs you to recover the trade goods he was bringing back from Bree from the waggon he abandoned outside Overhill.\n",
[11189]="70067540\n1\tCollect venom from spiders at Maj Khibi (total: 10)\tKúlthrak has asked you to hunt down spiders for venom. Spiders can be found at Maj Khibi, which is located north-west of Kafagur.\n2\tTalk to Kúlthrak at Kafagur\tYou have collected enough spider venom. You should give the phials to Kúlthrak at Kafagur.\n",
[11190]="70003723\n1\tDefeat Iornaith\tSprigley's farm is south of Bronwe's Folly. One entrance to the spider tunnels lies through the cellar of Sprigley's shed, while the other is through the cave mouth due west of the Hunter's Lodge. To prevent Iornaith's brood from overrunning Archet, Atli Spider-bane has asked you to find and slay the spider-queen. Atli suggests searching the spider caves beneath Sprigley's farm for a secret entrance into the Iornaith's lair.\n2\tTalk to Atli Spider-bane in Archet\tAtli Spider-bane can be found at the north end of Archet, west of the spider-cave, north-west of Sprigley's farm. You should take news of Iornaith's defeat to Atli Spider-bane.\n",
[11191]="70019666\n1\tTalk to Atli Spider-bane in Archet\tAtli Spider-bane is in Archet. You fought and defeated Iornaith, a spider of great power, while searching the tunnels west of Archet. Knowing that the dwarf, Atli, is often referred to as the Spider-bane, you should bring proof of your deeds back to Archet to show to the dwarf.\n",
[11192]="700082ED\n1\tDefeat spiders (total: 15)\tThe foul spiders reside in the south-eastern area of the Kingsfell in the shadow of the mountain. You should hunt down and slay the spiders that plague the area.\n2\tCompleted\tYou have assisted the Rangers of Esteldín in their daily vigilance, maintaining that the lands of the North Downs are free from enemy control.\n",
[11193]="70016B30\n1\tDefeat spiders (total: 8)\tSpiders may be found around Tunzelgund, east of the Shadowed Refuge. Klintur has asked you to defeat many spiders in the Foundations of Stone.\n2\tTalk to Klintur at the Shadowed Refuge\tKlintur can be found at the Shadowed Refuge, west from Tunzelgund. You should return to Klintur with news of your success.\n",
[11194]="700164D8\n1\tRepair lamps near Gabil-munz (total: 8)\030Collect Bag of Polished Glass-spider Legs\tThe empty lamp-posts can be found all over Gabil-munz, south-west of the Rotting Cellar. Thrand would like you to place the polished glass-spider legs inside the posts to repair them.\n2\tTalk to Thrand in the Rotting Cellar\tThrand is in the Rotting Cellar, north-east of Gabil-munz. You should return to Thrand and inform him the glass-spider legs worked and the lamp-posts have been repaired.\n",
[11195]="70001859\n1\tDefeat the Spider-queen\tThe Kingsfell Spider-queen is somewhere in the spider-lair south of Esteldín. You should slay the queen of the spiders who threaten the people of Esteldín, thereby lessening the danger posed by the foul creatures.\n2\tDefeat Kingsfell Spider-queen\tThe Kingsfell Spider-queen is somewhere in the spider-lair south of Esteldín. You should slay the queen of the spiders who threaten the people of Esteldín, thereby lessening the danger posed by the foul creatures.\n3\tTalk to Dagoras\tDagoras is at Esteldín. You should speak with Dagoras and inform him that you have slain the spider-queen.\n",
[11196]="70030A15\n1\tClimb the stairs near the Huorn\tStairs lead up to a forebidding area near the Huorn you rescued in northern Fangorn. You should climb to stairs to investigate, for you suspect an infestation of spiders.\n2\tDefeat spiderlings (total: 30)\tSpiderlings crawl all over the forest floor in the Silkenhold. You should defeat the spiderlings, for even the young are as evil and fell as their elders, and these monsters do not grow better with age.\n3\tCompleted\tYou have squashed many of the swarming spiderlings in the Silkenhold of Fangorn. The trees in this choked part of the forest may rest assured that the promise of future evil has been somewhat lessened.\n",
[11197]="70032F04\n1\tTalk to Limgarag\tTalk to Limgarag at the entrance to the Scuttledells.\n2\tFind all captured Elves in cocoons ([see journal]/13)\tFind and release all the Elves captured in cocoons.\n",
[11198]="700333E8\n1\tTalk to Limgarag\tTalk to Limgarag at the entrance to the Scuttledells.\n2\tFind all captured Elves in cocoons ([see journal]/13)\tFind and release all the Elves captured in cocoons.\n",
[11199]="7006625F\n1\tDiscover Dâr Matum\tSpiders have inhabited the ruins of Dâr Matum.\n2\tDefeat spiders in Dâr Matum (total: 10)\tSpiders have inhabited the ruins of Dâr Matum. Defeat spiders.\n3\tCompleted\tYou have defeated many spiders in Dâr Matum.\n",
[11200]="700079CD\n1\tDefeat spiders at the Old East Path (total: 5)\030Search for the missing hunter\tThe Old East Path is west of the hunter's lodge. Suspecting that Jon Brackenbrook's hunter went off for an ale instead of the duty he was hired for, Atli asked you to go in and clear out the spiders. He also mentioned that you ought to search for the missing hunter, while you were out there.\n2\tBring the axe to Atli Spider-bane\tAtli Spider-bane can be found out front of the hunter's lodge. While clearing the spiders from the Old East Path, you found the first hunter Atli had sent out, slain by the spiders. In the hunter's hand was Atli's axe, but it was broken during battle. You should return to Atli with the ill news.\n",
})
